cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SimuLean, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SimuLean"
abstract: >-
  An open-source 3D discrete-event simulator on the Unity engine, designed to be
  programmed by AI agents: a discrete-event engine that also runs headless, its
  Unity integration layer, an element library for manufacturing and logistics,
  experimentation and optimisation, and domain-level commands exposed to AI
  agents through the Model Context Protocol.
